# Credentials for yasp-agent's `yasp-toolkit`, which the kernelgen and kernelgen evaluation
# steps run. yasp-toolkit reads this variable from the environment, so export it before
# running the check (for example `set -a; . ./.env; set +a`); nothing reads this file for you.
# Create a key at https://compile.yasp.ai/dashboard/tokens, or store one in the OS keyring
# instead with `yasp-toolkit keyring set` and leave the variable unset.
# When the check starts a Gaia worker, yasp-toolkit mints scoped registry and registration keys
# from this key. Only the registration key enters the worker container; this key stays on the host.
YASP_API_KEY=
